{"v":1,"book":"1Chr","ch":18,"verses":[{"n":1,"text":"And after this David struck the Philistines and subdued them. And he took Gath and her villages out of the hand of the Philistines.","tok":[{"t":"And after "},{"t":"this","s":["H0310"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"David","s":["H1732"],"a":[4]},{"t":" "},{"t":"struck","s":["H5221"],"a":[3]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"Philistines","s":["H6430"],"a":[6]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"subdued","s":["H3665"],"a":[7]},{"t":" them. And he "},{"t":"took","s":["H3947"],"a":[8]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Gath","s":["H1661"],"a":[10]},{"t":" and her villages out of the "},{"t":"hand","s":["H3027"],"a":[12]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"Philistines","s":["H6430"],"a":[13]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":2,"text":"And he struck Moab, and the Moabites became servants to David and brought tribute.","tok":[{"t":"And he struck "},{"t":"Moab","s":["H4124"],"a":[2]},{"t":", and the "},{"t":"Moabites","s":["H4124"],"a":[4]},{"t":" "},{"t":"became","s":["H1732"],"a":[6]},{"t":" "},{"t":"servants","s":["H5650"],"a":[5]},{"t":" to David and "},{"t":"brought","s":["H5375"],"a":[7]},{"t":" "},{"t":"tribute","s":["H4503"],"a":[8]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":3,"text":"Then David struck Hadadezer the king of Zobah at Hamath, when he went to establish his power at the river Euphrates.","tok":[{"t":"Then "},{"t":"David","s":["H1732"],"a":[1]},{"t":" struck Hadadezer the "},{"t":"king","s":["H4428"],"a":[4]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Zobah","s":["H6678"],"a":[5]},{"t":" at "},{"t":"Hamath","s":["H2574"],"a":[6]},{"t":", when he "},{"t":"went","s":["H3212"]},{"t":" to establish his power at the "},{"t":"river","s":["H5104"],"a":[10]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Euphrates","s":["H6578"],"a":[11]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":4,"text":"And David took from him one thousand chariots and seven thousand horsemen and twenty thousand foot soldiers. And David hamstrung all the chariot horses but left enough of them for a hundred chariots.","tok":[{"t":"And "},{"t":"David","s":["H1732"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"took","s":["H3920"],"a":[0]},{"t"